      slug: "showgirl-maren-morris-vows",
      date: "2026-08-01",
      dateLabel: "August 1, 2026",
      title: "Maren Morris on the vows: \"a closer look into their love and humor\"",
      summary: "Country singer Maren Morris, a guest at the July 3 wedding, told People the couple's self-written vows gave the room \"a closer look into their love for each other and their sense of humor.\"",
      body: ["Among the roughly 1,000 guests at Madison Square Garden on July 3 was country singer Maren Morris, and in early August she became one of the few to describe the couple's self-written vows on the record. Speaking to People, she kept the private lines private but named what the exchange revealed — \"a closer look into their love for each other and their sense of humor\" — and called witnessing it \"an honor.\"", "Her account restores the lighter register the fuller guest reports had left out: those dwelt on how long and how emotional the vows ran; Morris caught the jokes the two wrote into them. Any figures on the vows' length trace to reporting around her comments, not to Morris."],
      tags: ["Relationship"],
      images: [{ url: "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/Maren_Morris_2019_by_Glenn_Francis_%28cropped%29.jpg", credit: "Glenn Francis / PacificProDigital.com, Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 4.0", caption: "Maren Morris at the iHeartRadio Music Awards, Los Angeles, March 2019.", kind: "primary", focalPoint: "50% 38%" }, { url: "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/Maren_Morris_Gershwin_Prize_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg", credit: "UKinUSA (UK Embassy Washington), CC BY-SA 2.0, via Wikimedia Commons", caption: "Maren Morris at the 2024 Gershwin Prize ceremony in Washington, D.C.", kind: "archival", focalPoint: "48% 24%" }],
      sources: [{ name: "Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce's Wedding Vows Offered 'a Closer Look into Their Love and Humor,' Maren Morris Says", url: "https://www.aol.com/articles/taylor-swift-travis-kelce-wedding-163000000.html", reliability: 3, type: "reputable_press" }, { name: "Maren Morris Gives Insight into Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce's Vows", url: "https://www.tmz.com/2026/08/01/maren-morris-talks-taylor-swift-travis-kelce-wedding-vows/", reliability: 3, type: "reputable_press" }, { name: "Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce's wedding vows revealed their 'love and humor'", url: "https://www.hola.com/us/celebrities/20260802916042/taylor-swift-and-travis-kelces-wedding-vows-revealed-their-love-and-humor/", reliability: 2, type: "reputable_press" }, { name: "Taylor Swift & Travis Kelce's Wedding Vows: What Guests Have Revealed", url: "https://www.billboard.com/music/music-news/taylor-swift-travis-kelce-wedding-vows-1236287859/", reliability: 4, type: "reputable_press" }],
